  "On 1h, AO crossing up through 0 gave 3,606 entries in 2,747 separate moves. Twenty candles later these entries were 0.01% ahead of random entries, inside the luck band. Shorting the cross down through 0 came out 0.07% ahead, also inside the band. On 4h the same cross fires about a quarter as often and also lands inside the band.",
